{"id":"n78198-1-7","stage":3,"title":"쫓아다니다 · 跟随","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78198-1-7-1","ko":"저렇게 너를 쫓아다니는데 한 번쯤은 만나 주지 그래?","zh":"他都那样追着你不放，至少见他一面吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저렇게","audio":"/audio/3e51b4147d3689f85089.mp3"}},{"text":"너를","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너를","audio":"/audio/439e524cbf5378e2d47a.mp3"}},{"text":"쫓아다니는데","meaning":"跟随，追随","explanation":"쫓아다니다：跟随，追随；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"쫓아다니다","audio":"/audio/5d1a549fbe115c11ac36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78198","senseId":"1","lemma":"쫓아다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쫓아다니는데","audio":"/audio/7b25fcbf745ef508b221.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"번쯤은","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번쯤은","audio":"/audio/a6f22cb2173cc55a5e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"만나","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나","audio":"/audio/3fecb3f7ca424d687c50.mp3"}},{"text":"주지","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주지","audio":"/audio/509f8c1c91f136687ac0.mp3"}},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"5d1a549fbe115c11","term":"쫓아다니다","zh":"跟随，追随","audio":"/audio/5d1a549fbe115c11ac36.mp3","entryId":"78198","definition":"跟在别人后面。","pronunciation":["쪼차다니다"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea87369beda16f7f5533.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78198-1-7-2","ko":"싫어. 난 저 남자가 정말 싫다니까!","zh":"不要。我真的讨厌那个男人！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"싫어.","meaning":"讨厌","explanation":"싫다：讨厌；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"1","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싫어","audio":"/audio/fb109362c8ef3fae2aaf.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"남자가","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자가","audio":"/audio/2febf4b5eefa29bbf8ef.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"싫다니까!","meaning":"讨厌","explanation":"싫다：讨厌；다니까：再次强调已经说过的内容，非敬语：“都说了……”。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"so